# Flipper Zero NFC dumps → Proxmark3 / magic CUID cards
# =====================================================
#
# Real card dumps contain UID + data that could identify their owner.
# They must NEVER be committed. The .bin files produced by these
# scripts are byte-for-byte equivalent to the source .nfc files.

# Flipper Zero captures (raw input)
*.nfc

# Proxmark3 + script output (raw binary dumps, JSON dumps, keys, logs)
*.bin
*.json
hf-mf-*-key.bin
dump_*.log
dump_*.bin.json

# Anything in a dedicated dump subtree of the repo
ProxmarkDumps/dumps/